    title: "Space Invaders",
    developer: Some("Rick Maurer"),
    description: Some("The player slides a laser cannon along the foot of the screen, firing up at a block of thirty-six aliens that marches sideways and drops a row closer with each pass. Three hits on the cannon end the game; clearing a wave brings another. Console switches select the game setting, among them invisible aliens, moving shields and zig-zagging alien fire, and two people can play at the same time rather than alternating."),
